{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33170","headline":"效陶彭泽 · 司马扎","name":"效陶彭泽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一梦倏已尽，百年如露草。\n独有南山高，不与人共老。\n尊中贮灵味，无事即醉倒。\n何必鸣鼓锺，然後乐怀抱。\n轻波向海疾，浮云归谷早。\n形役良可嗟，唯能狥天道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}